Q 10: Can a DCE client connect to multiple servers?
Q 11: Can a DCE server export multiple interfaces?
Q 12: Can a process be both a server and a client?
Q 13: How do I perform asynchronous RPC?
Q 14: How can a server keep track of multiple clients?
